    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0033_40c1ad826a08.png\" style=\"width:1.72014in;height:1.71319in\" /><br />Let angle <math><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi></math><br />then in <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R,</mi></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>"
